# TT-Workbench:统一 LF,防止 Windows autocrlf 破坏 vendor 快照的字节级
# SHA-256 完整性校验(上游在 Windows 上 16 项测试失败的根因,见
# docs/CODE-REVIEW-TT.md 基线事实节)。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 源码与文本资产显式声明,不依赖客户端 git 配置
*.ts text eol=lf
*.mts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.map text eol=lf

# 二进制资产
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary

# 上游以 CRLF 字节存储的文件:按字节原样保留(第三方声明逐字保留,不转换)
package-lock.json -text
.gitignore -text
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt -text
